     "url": "https://www.are.na/block/52022089",
     "text": "Needoh Player\nMy project mixes the joys of squishing a needoh and playing music. \nBackstory: I love the song Jennifer and was introduced to it in middle school. I love needohs and squishing them, and I discovered them earlier this month.  \nThe overall idea was that when I squish the needoh, it plays the song, and when I let go, it pauses. Unfortunately, I couldn't figure it out. "
